      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you aren't a doctor but i'm kinda desperate here. the toothache is making it hard to sleep and i dont really have time to go to the clinic today. the omeprazole usually does a good job of keeping the stomach stuff under control, so wouldnt that just protect me from the advil irritating my stomach? i just need to know if it's generally okay to take them together for a bit.",
